### 4.7 Subscription & Payments

#### 4.7.1 Plans Page (`/plans`)

| Plan | Price | Features |
|------|-------|----------|
| **Solo Screen** | ₹499/cycle | 8K resolution, single stream, cinematic sound, offline storage, zero-ad |
| **Party Hub** | ₹1,499/cycle | 8K multi-stream, up to 12 screens, sharing, priority bandwidth, admin controls, cross-platform, elite support |

- Group plan includes per-screen cost calculator with slider (5–12 screens)
- Razorpay integration for payment processing
- Mock payment tunnel fallback when backend is unavailable

#### 4.7.2 Payment API (`/api/payments`)
- `POST /create-order` — Creates Razorpay order
- `POST /webhook` — Handles Razorpay webhook (raw body for signature verification)

