### 4.8 Settings (`/settings`)

8-tab settings panel with sidebar navigation:

| Tab | Controls |
|-----|----------|
| **Account** | Profile preview, link to profile page |
| **Subscription** | Current tier display, upgrade CTA |
| **Playback** | Auto-play next episode toggle, audio description toggle |
| **Safety** | Age filter slider (G → NC-17), profile lock PIN toggle |
| **Wellbeing** | Weekly watch time bar chart, daily quota threshold slider (30min–5hr) |
| **Accessibility** | High contrast mode, motion reduction |
| **Language** | Interface language (7 languages), subtitle/caption language (8 options) — synced to Firestore |
| **Downloads** | Storage usage bar, cache wipe action |

Settings are managed via a React Context (`SettingsContext`) with `useSettings()` hook.

