### 4.9 Social & Friends System

**Backend Routes (`/api/friends`):**
- Friend request, accept, decline, unfriend workflows
- Friend list retrieval
- Real-time status updates via Socket.IO

---

### 4.10 AI-Powered Recommendations

**Backend Route (`/api/recommendations`):**
- Powered by **Google Gemini AI** (`@google/genai`)
- Generates personalized content suggestions
- Used in Watch Room mood-based content matching

---

### 4.11 Admin Dashboard (`/admin`)

- Admin verification via Firestore `admins` collection
- Protected by `verifyToken` + `verifyAdmin` middleware chain
- Content management, user management, moderation tools
- Socket-based admin notifications

---

### 4.12 Feedback & Contact

- **Contact Page** (`/contact`): User feedback form
- **Backend** (`/api/feedback`): Stores feedback, handles room moderation reports
- Shared route handles both `/api/feedback` and `/api/contact`

