## 5. API Architecture

### 5.1 REST API Routes

| Route Prefix | Module | Auth Required |
|-------------|--------|---------------|
| `/api/content` | Content CRUD & TMDB integration | Varies |
| `/api/users` | User profiles, status updates | Yes |
| `/api/friends` | Friend system | Yes |
| `/api/payments` | Razorpay orders & webhooks | Varies |
| `/api/party` | Watch room CRUD | Yes |
| `/api/feedback` | Feedback & reports | Yes |
| `/api/admin` | Admin operations | Yes (Admin) |
| `/api/recommendations` | AI suggestions | Yes |

### 5.2 Security

- **Helmet.js** for HTTP headers
- **CORS** whitelist: `localhost:5173`, `localhost:3000`, configurable `CLIENT_URL`
- **Rate Limiting** via `express-rate-limit`
- **Firebase Admin token verification** with JWT fallback for local development
- **Request validation** via `express-validator`

---

## 6. UI/UX Design System

### 6.1 Design Language

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Theme** | Ultra-dark, cinematic (pure black backgrounds with glassmorphism) |
| **Primary Color** | Accent Gold (`accent-gold` — golden amber) |
| **Typography** | System font stack, all-caps with extreme letter-spacing for labels |
| **Border Radius** | Large rounded corners (`rounded-[2rem]` to `rounded-[3rem]`) |
| **Effects** | Glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur`), ambient glow blurs, pulse animations |
| **Transitions** | 500ms–1000ms ease-out transitions on all interactive elements |

### 6.2 Design Tokens (CSS Classes)

| Class | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `glass-card` | Primary container — frosted glass card with border and blur |
| `glass-pill` | Tag/badge — small rounded pill with glass effect |
| `glass-pill-active` | Active/primary CTA — bright glass pill |
| `shadow-2xl` / `shadow-3xl` | Deep, dramatic drop shadows |
| `accent-gold` | Primary brand color for highlights and CTAs |

### 6.3 Motion Design
- **Page transitions**: `framer-motion` with opacity + y-axis slide
- **Content cards**: Staggered entrance animations with `delay: index * 0.05`
- **Hover effects**: Scale (1.02–1.1), grayscale removal, border glow
- **Loading states**: Spinning border + pulsing blur backdrop
- **Opening animation**: Full-screen branded intro sequence

### 6.4 Responsive Design
- Mobile-first with `md:` and `lg:` Tailwind breakpoints
- Collapsible sidebar in Settings (mobile shows menu → tab → back button flow)
- Stacked layouts on mobile, side-by-side on desktop
- Typography scaling: `text-4xl → md:text-8xl` for headlines

